--- !u!114 &1737516137
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1737516135}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ff75639f1cca92441a855d8d47a7ca51, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  textComponent: {fileID: 1207035444}
  lines:
  - line: Pagkatapos ng kagubatan ay mararating ng bayani ang isang tahimik na lambak.
    enemyToSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    specificCharacter: 0
    characterLine: []
    isQuestion: 0
    choices:
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    correctAnswerIndex: 0
    difficultyLevel: 1
    isFinalEnemy: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cf6d70fe4d95f4b409a7d9cea32bf956, type: 3}
    characterVoiceClips: []
  - line: Dito dating nakatira ang mga tagapangalaga ng kaalaman ng Mayumiya. Ngunit
      ngayon ay tila iniwan na ito ng buhay.
    enemyToSpawn: {fileID: 4414144011614825618, guid: 656c3eed8696fa440a07beecfd5ced37, type: 3}
    specificCharacter: 0
    characterLine: []
    isQuestion: 0
    choices:
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    correctAnswerIndex: 0
    difficultyLevel: 1
    isFinalEnemy: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7998b736e14274c4783b0c1da1f96b18, type: 3}
    characterVoiceClips: []
  - line: Ang mga pangungusap na nakaukit sa mga bato ay hindi na buo. Ang mga kuwento
      sa mga dingding ng sinaunang templo ay may nawawalang bahagi.
    enemyToSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    specificCharacter: 0
    characterLine: []
    isQuestion: 0
    choices:
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    correctAnswerIndex: 0
    difficultyLevel: 1
    isFinalEnemy: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 701972efa6eb9564b9d7f83b2a215fe4, type: 3}
    characterVoiceClips: []
  - line: "Ang mga salita ay magkakahiwalay at tila wala nang koneksyon sa isa\u2019t
      isa."
    enemyToSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    specificCharacter: 0
    characterLine: []
    isQuestion: 0
    choices:
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    correctAnswerIndex: 0
    difficultyLevel: 1
    isFinalEnemy: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9031e2a9a6aca3940a94029783306f7e, type: 3}
    characterVoiceClips: []
  - line: Habang naglalakad ang bayani sa lambak, kailangan niyang muling buuin ang
      kahulugan ng mga salita
    enemyToSpawn: {fileID: 4414144011614825618, guid: 656c3eed8696fa440a07beecfd5ced37, type: 3}
    specificCharacter: 0
    characterLine: []
    isQuestion: 0
    choices:
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    correctAnswerIndex: 0
    difficultyLevel: 1
    isFinalEnemy: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 13aa5a489b4aee547990e398e9a7e537, type: 3}
    characterVoiceClips: []
  - line: Ang bawat salita ay may kaugnayan sa iba. Ang tapang ay may kaugnayan sa
      dangal.
    enemyToSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    specificCharacter: 0
    characterLine: []
    isQuestion: 0
    choices:
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    correctAnswerIndex: 0
    difficultyLevel: 1
    isFinalEnemy: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5ac9cf362a4591946868d7f619a452cb, type: 3}
    characterVoiceClips: []
  - line: 'Ang pag-asa ay may kaugnayan sa liwanag. Ang lunas ay bunga ng malasakit.

'
    enemyToSpawn: {fileID: 4414144011614825618, guid: 656c3eed8696fa440a07beecfd5ced37, type: 3}
    specificCharacter: 0
    characterLine: []
    isQuestion: 0
    choices:
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    correctAnswerIndex: 0
    difficultyLevel: 1
    isFinalEnemy: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: bd78bc4b1981d264db67db741863de54, type: 3}
    characterVoiceClips: []
  - line: 'Sa tuwing nabubuo ang tamang kahulugan, mas lumalakas ang kapangyarihan
      ng bayani.

'
    enemyToSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    specificCharacter: 0
    characterLine: []
    isQuestion: 0
    choices:
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    correctAnswerIndex: 0
    difficultyLevel: 1
    isFinalEnemy: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cf8d04e45995d1840986a73f3384c539, type: 3}
    characterVoiceClips: []
  - line: 
    enemyToSpawn: {fileID: 0}
    specificCharacter: 1
    characterLine:
    - Ang tubig ni ay mas malinaw at mas malakas ang agos.
    - Ang hangin ni ay mas mabilis at mas matalim.
    - 'Ang apoy ni ay nagiging mas maliwanag at mas mainit. '
    - Ang lupa ni ay mas nagiging matatag at matibay.
    isQuestion: 0
    choices:
    - 
    - 
    - 
    - 
    correctAnswerIndex: 0
    difficultyLevel: 1
    isFinalEnemy: 0
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
